      "idx": 0,
      "code": "FUNCTION_BLOCK HVAC_Control\nVAR_INPUT\n    OCCUPANCY_DETECTED    : BOOL;\n    ENERGY_SAVING_MODE    : BOOL;\n    HVAC_MODE_SELECTOR    : INT;\nEND_VAR\n\nVAR_OUTPUT\n    SUPPLY_FAN_RUN        : BOOL := FALSE;\n    TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST  : INT := 0;\nEND_VAR\n\nVAR\n    fanDelayTimer : TON;\n    fanConditionsMet : BOOL;\n    rawAdjustment : INT;\nEND_VAR\n\n(* Fan delay logic: 30s on, instant off *)\nfanConditionsMet := OCCUPANCY_DETECTED AND (HVAC_MODE_SELECTOR <> 3);\n\nfanDelayTimer(\n    IN  := fanConditionsMet,\n    PT  := T#30S\n);\n\nIF fanDelayTimer.Q THEN\n    SUPPLY_FAN_RUN := TRUE;\nELSE\n    SUPPLY_FAN_RUN := FALSE;\nEND_IF;\n\n(* Temperature setpoint calculation *)\nrawAdjustment := 0;\n\nCASE HVAC_MODE_SELECTOR OF\n    0: (* Auto mode *)\n        IF OCCUPANCY_DETECTED THEN\n            rawAdjustment := 0;\n        ELSE\n            IF ENERGY_SAVING_MODE THEN\n                rawAdjustment := 3;\n            ELSE\n                rawAdjustment := 2;\n            END_IF;\n        END_IF;\n\n    1: (* Comfort mode *)\n        IF OCCUPANCY_DETECTED THEN\n            rawAdjustment := 0;\n        ELSE\n            rawAdjustment := 1;\n        END_IF;\n\n    2: (* Economy mode *)\n        IF OCCUPANCY_DETECTED THEN\n            rawAdjustment := 0;\n        ELSE\n            rawAdjustment := 4;\n        END_IF;\n\n    3: (* Night mode *)\n        rawAdjustment := 4;\n\nELSE\n    rawAdjustment := 0;\nEND_CASE;\n\n(* Clamp to ±4°C *)\nIF rawAdjustment > 4 THEN\n    TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST := 4;\nELSIF rawAdjustment < -4 THEN\n    TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST := -4;\nELSE\n    TEMP_SETPOINT_ADJUST := rawAdjustment;\nEND_IF;\n\nEND_FUNCTION_BLOCK",
      "code_hash": "b697e345b4c9431e1a77ef39c4d69a6e1d485bc6b99f7ab85cfee3fc05ed1c9f",
